// 递归的视图类型：经借用字段指向同类型的视图。参数名下的来源只展开到第一次回到同一类型为止，更深的归到那个字段名下
class Arr(len: Int)
view class Node(borrow next: Node, borrow data: Arr)
fun leaf(borrow a: Arr): Node from a trusted
fun own(borrow n: Node): borrow Int from n.data { return &n.data.len }
fun second(borrow n: Node): borrow Int from n.next { return &n.next.data.len }
fun third(borrow n: Node): borrow Int from n.next { return &n.next.next.data.len }
fun wrongBranch(borrow n: Node): borrow Int from n.data {
  return &n.next.next.data.len  // ERR K6
}
fun undeclared(borrow n: Node): borrow Int {
  return &n.next.data.len  // ERR K6
}
fun walk(borrow n: Node): borrow Int from n.next {
  val cur = &n.next
  while (*) {
    cur = &cur.next
  }
  return &cur.data.len
}
fun deepSourceIsProtected(): Unit {
  val a = Arr(1)
  val b = Arr(2)
  val c = Arr(3)
  val n1 = leaf(&a)
  val n2 = Node(&n1, &b)
  val n3 = Node(&n2, &c)
  val e = third(&n3)
  c.len = 4
  a.len = 5  // ERR K1
  use(e)
}
fun ownDataOnly(): Unit {
  val a = Arr(1)
  val b = Arr(2)
  val n1 = leaf(&a)
  val n2 = Node(&n1, &b)
  val e = own(&n2)
  a.len = 5
  b.len = 6  // ERR K1
  use(e)
}
fun walkProtectsTheChain(): Unit {
  val a = Arr(1)
  val b = Arr(2)
  val n1 = leaf(&a)
  val n2 = Node(&n1, &b)
  val e = walk(&n2)
  a.len = 5  // ERR K1
  use(e)
}
fun chainOutlivesSource(): Unit {
  val b = Arr(2)
  {
    val a = Arr(1)
    val n1 = leaf(&a)
    val n2 = Node(&n1, &b)
    use(n2.data.len)
  }
  b.len = 3
}
